{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo is now available!\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/404f905a72a1e342291f320462846b2a.poster.avif?t=1773056922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/404f905a72a1e342291f320462846b2a.webm?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/404f905a72a1e342291f320462846b2a.mp4?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight Billiards</strong> is a <strong>turn-based</strong> <strong>roguelite</strong> game inspired by <i>Peglin</i> and billiards. Your goal is to bounce\u00a0 the ball\u00a0strategically  across the pool, triggering various post effects along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each game, you\u2019ll collect various items to deck-build your own unique playstyle. Spend your money in the shop to purchase items. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you\u2019ll encounter all kinds of characters and mini-challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultimately, you\u2019ll face the boss of the building and strive to become the King of Midnight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rotate and Shoot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/b6069642f01a6c1974e828f8b58e807f.poster.avif?t=1773056922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/b6069642f01a6c1974e828f8b58e807f.webm?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/b6069642f01a6c1974e828f8b58e807f.mp4?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Pool Tables for Various PlayStyles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/658ca4e2ea0db930c247c4387970070c.poster.avif?t=1773056922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/658ca4e2ea0db930c247c4387970070c.webm?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/658ca4e2ea0db930c247c4387970070c.mp4?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect Items and Deck-build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/7d3e632546634bd3d9acf7f11d8fb9f9.poster.avif?t=1773056922\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/7d3e632546634bd3d9acf7f11d8fb9f9.webm?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546480/extras/7d3e632546634bd3d9acf7f11d8fb9f9.mp4?t=1773056922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satisfying impact effects for an exciting gameplay experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of selectable characters, each with unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different customizable pool for various playstyles.<